  "question": {
    "text": "The reversible expansion of an ideal gas under adiabatic and isothermal conditions is shown in the figure. Which of the following statement is incorrect?<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0001_729a798819fa.jpeg\" style=\"height: 154px; width: 230px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
